WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.782
At the active clock edge: J=K=0 holds Q, J=0 K=1 resets, J=1 K=0 sets, and J=K=1 toggles.

00:00:09.782 --> 00:00:14.960
Unlike an RS latch, the 11 input is defined.

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:25.742
At the active clock edge: J=K=0 holds Q, J=0 K=1 resets, J=1 K=0 sets, and J=K=1 toggles.

00:00:25.742 --> 00:00:30.920
Unlike an RS latch, the 11 input is defined.

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:36.864
Modify one input or condition, predict the output, then check your prediction.

00:00:36.864 --> 00:00:38.924
Do not leave inputs floating.

00:00:38.924 --> 00:00:46.340
